 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|FTAButton|Set file type associations for this RemoteApp.\\r\\nChanges here will only affect this client connection. They will not be saved.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|FTAButton|设置该远程应用的文件类型关联。\\r\\n此处修改仅影响本次客户端连接，不会保存。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|DisabledFTACheckBox|Do not include file type associations in this client connection.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|DisabledFTACheckBox|本次连接不包含文件类型关联。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|SaveButton|Save window settings for next time.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|SaveButton|保存窗口设置供下次使用。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|ResetButton|Reset window settings to defaults.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|ResetButton|恢复窗口默认设置。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|CancelEditButton|Close and return to the main window.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|CancelEditButton|关闭并返回主窗口。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|CreateButton|Create the client connection and choose where to save it.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|CreateButton|创建客户端连接并选择保存位置。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|UseRDGatewayCheckBox|Use a Remote Desktop Gateway to connect to the host.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|UseRDGatewayCheckBox|通过远程桌面网关连接主机。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|AttemptDirectCheckBox|Try a direct connection first, if that fails then use the Remote Desktop Gateway.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|AttemptDirectCheckBox|优先直连，失败后再走远程桌面网关。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|ShortcutTagCheckBox|Append some text to the end of each shortcut title.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|ShortcutTagCheckBox|在每个快捷方式标题末尾追加文字。\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|PerMachineRadioButton|Should the shortcuts install for all users (per-machine), or only for the logged in user (per user)?\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|PerMachineRadioButton|快捷方式为所有用户安装（每计算机），还是仅当前登录用户（每用户）？\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|PerUserRadioButton|Should the shortcuts install for all users (per-machine), or only for the logged in user (per user)?\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|PerUserRadioButton|快捷方式为所有用户安装（每计算机），还是仅当前登录用户（每用户）？\r\n",
 "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|CheckBoxSignRDPEnabled|Digitally sign the RDP file.\r\n": "RemoteAppCreateClientConnection|CheckBoxSignRDPEnabled|对 RDP 文件进行数字签名。\r\n",
